  data: {
    LLM: '1. Pitching: The player who leads the first card (the pitcher) determines the trump suit by the suit of the card they lead.\n2. Trick-Taking: Players must follow suit if possible. In some variants (following All Fours), you may choose to trump even if you can follow suit.\n3. Card Ranking: A (high) K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2.',
    Player: '1. Pitching: The player who leads the first card (the pitcher) determines the trump suit by the suit of the card they lead.\n2. Trick-Taking: Players must follow suit if possible. In some variants (following All Fours), you may choose to trump even if you can follow suit.\n3. Card Ranking: A (high) K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2.',
